<title>CHINA: TABLE-Paramount yr net loss HK$75.28 mln.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Paramount yr net loss HK$75.28 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   32.1 loss  vs 14.2 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  39.75 loss vs 5.07 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    75.28 loss vs 33.17 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     380.85     vs 353.90</p>
<p>    Company name		 Paramount Publishing Group Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 19-25</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Paramount is a printing and paper bag making firm.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss on sale of leasehold and building, and tangible fixed assets written off upon factory removal.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
